):
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
\left\Vert v-w\right\Vert ^{2} & =\left\Vert v\right\Vert +\left\Vert w\right\Vert {\color{red}-2\cdot\left\Vert v\right\Vert \cdot\left\Vert w\right\Vert \cdot\cos\left(\theta\right)}\\
\left\Vert v+w\right\Vert ^{2} & =\left\Vert v\right\Vert +\left\Vert w\right\Vert -2\cdot\left\Vert v\right\Vert \cdot\left\Vert w\right\Vert \cdot\cos\left(\pi-\theta\right)\\
 & =\left\Vert v\right\Vert +\left\Vert w\right\Vert {\color{red}+2\cdot\left\Vert v\right\Vert \cdot\left\Vert w\right\Vert \cdot\cos\left(\theta\right)}
\end{align*}

\end_inset

ולכן 
\begin_inset Formula $\left\Vert v+w\right\Vert ^{2}+\left\Vert v-w\right\Vert ^{2}=2\cdot\left(\left\Vert v\right\Vert ^{2}+\left\Vert w\right\Vert ^{2}\right)$
\end_inset

.
