\left(T^{-1}\right)^{*}\circ T^{*} & =\left(T\circ T^{-1}\right)^{*}=\MKid_{W}^{*}=\MKid_{W}\\
T^{*}\circ\left(T^{-1}\right)^{*} & =\left(T^{-1}\circ T\right)^{*}=\MKid_{V}^{*}=\MKid_{V}
