\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\left\langle v\mid v'\right\rangle _{V}=\left\langle T\left(v\right)\mid T\left(v'\right)\right\rangle _{W}=\left\langle 0_{W}\mid T\left(v'\right)\right\rangle _{W}=0
\]

\end_inset

מכאן ש-
\begin_inset Formula $v=0_{V}$
\end_inset

,
 כלומר 
