 & =\sum_{i=1}^{k}\left\langle u_{i}\mid w\right\rangle \cdot u_{i}+\sum_{i=k+1}^{n}{\color{red}\left\langle u_{i}\mid w\right\rangle }\cdot u_{i}=w=p_{W}\left(v\right)
